{"source_file": "state/2026-06-25-artefact-facets-guide-link-and-content-profile.md", "hash": "20da049cf1c2cff74b7dd39f67bc03a9fbf2c52d5d343a972aa27f35e2e0a779", "nodes": [{"id": "state_2026_06_25_glcp_doc", "label": "State doc 2026-06-25: artefact tag-facets guide-link + content-profile — the reconciled tag-facet design recovered from git history + transcripts; supersedes the same-day tag-facets-vs-routing doc and DESIGN/MODEL_CONTRACTS facet sections.", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-artefact-facets-guide-link-and-content-profile.md"}, {"id": "state_2026_06_25_glcp_tag_facets_not_routing", "label": "Load-bearing cut: tag-facets = a semantic description of the phrase (no numbers); routing = a separate downstream consumer that owns relevance/weighting and does not define what a facet is.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-artefact-facets-guide-link-and-content-profile.md"}, {"id": "state_2026_06_25_glcp_model_emits_no_numbers", "label": "The model emits NO numbers (tagger and interpreter); facet weights are measured by geometry downstream, never agent-assigned.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-artefact-facets-guide-link-and-content-profile.md"}, {"id": "state_2026_06_25_glcp_the_hollowing", "label": "Diagnosis: the v2 redesign hollowed the tag by allocating every dimension to a cheaper structure-or-interpreter home, leaving a bare topic phrase; entities and evidence were misread as facts.", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-artefact-facets-guide-link-and-content-profile.md"}, {"id": "state_2026_06_25_glcp_v1_content_profile", "label": "The real v1 facets were a CONTENT PROFILE: evidence = kind-of-information (definition/example/metric/argument/procedure/case_study/raw_data), entities = named-thing TYPE — both genuine semantic dimensions, not facts.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-artefact-facets-guide-link-and-content-profile.md"}, {"id": "state_2026_06_25_glcp_guide_link", "label": "The guide link: a facet is a shared concept both the tag and the prompt are measured-close-to; the match compares those two closenesses (v1 per-facet grounding bridge reborn), keeping symmetry.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-artefact-facets-guide-link-and-content-profile.md"}, {"id": "state_2026_06_25_glcp_topic_to_centrality", "label": "Topic is not a facet — the phrase IS the topic; what remains is topic-as-degree = centrality (how central a tag is vs its chunk siblings, chunk-local).", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-artefact-facets-guide-link-and-content-profile.md"}, {"id": "state_2026_06_25_glcp_max_facet_instrument", "label": "Candidate instrument (to probe, not trusted): rewrite a tag/prompt to be maximal on a facet, then embed-compare to the original; ranking by closeness = facet-relevance. Research warns it conflates wording change, topic leak, and the facet change.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-artefact-facets-guide-link-and-content-profile.md"}, {"id": "state_2026_06_25_glcp_postures_to_interpreter", "label": "Self-selecting property: closeness-to-a-concept only works for content facets; the postures (stance, communicative-function, TAM) have no single concept to sit close to and fall out to the interpreter.", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-artefact-facets-guide-link-and-content-profile.md"}], "edges": [{"source": "state_2026_06_25_glcp_tag_facets_not_routing", "target": "state_2026_06_25_glcp_doc", "relation": "part_of", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-artefact-facets-guide-link-and-content-profile.md"}, {"source": "state_2026_06_25_glcp_model_emits_no_numbers", "target": "state_2026_06_25_glcp_doc", "relation": "part_of", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-artefact-facets-guide-link-and-content-profile.md"}, {"source": "state_2026_06_25_glcp_the_hollowing", "target": "state_2026_06_25_glcp_doc", "relation": "part_of", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-artefact-facets-guide-link-and-content-profile.md"}, {"source": "state_2026_06_25_glcp_v1_content_profile", "target": "state_2026_06_25_glcp_doc", "relation": "part_of", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-artefact-facets-guide-link-and-content-profile.md"}, {"source": "state_2026_06_25_glcp_guide_link", "target": "state_2026_06_25_glcp_doc", "relation": "part_of", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-artefact-facets-guide-link-and-content-profile.md"}, {"source": "state_2026_06_25_glcp_topic_to_centrality", "target": "state_2026_06_25_glcp_doc", "relation": "part_of", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-artefact-facets-guide-link-and-content-profile.md"}, {"source": "state_2026_06_25_glcp_max_facet_instrument", "target": "state_2026_06_25_glcp_doc", "relation": "part_of", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-artefact-facets-guide-link-and-content-profile.md"}, {"source": "state_2026_06_25_glcp_postures_to_interpreter", "target": "state_2026_06_25_glcp_doc", "relation": "part_of", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-artefact-facets-guide-link-and-content-profile.md"}, {"source": "state_2026_06_25_glcp_the_hollowing", "target": "state_2026_06_25_glcp_v1_content_profile", "relation": "supports", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-artefact-facets-guide-link-and-content-profile.md"}, {"source": "state_2026_06_25_glcp_guide_link", "target": "state_2026_06_25_glcp_postures_to_interpreter", "relation": "supports", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-artefact-facets-guide-link-and-content-profile.md"}, {"source": "state_2026_06_25_glcp_max_facet_instrument", "target": "state_2026_06_25_glcp_guide_link", "relation": "supports", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "state/2026-06-25-artefact-facets-guide-link-and-content-profile.md"}]}